1. THE WEBRTC NATIVE LIBRARIES  (Google / The WebRTC project authors)
================================================================================

Every platform except Blazor embeds a prebuilt build of Google's WebRTC:

    Android         Jars/libwebrtc.aar
                      classes.jar and libjingle_peerconnection_so.so for
                      armeabi-v7a, arm64-v8a, x86 and x86_64
    iOS             WebRTC.xcframework
    Mac Catalyst    WebRTC.framework
    Windows         WebRtcInterop.dll and its import closure, in
                      runtimes/win-x64/native/

    Blazor          nothing — WebRTC is supplied by the browser

These are built from the WebRTC source tree by a separate repository,
https://github.com/melihercan/WebRTCnative, and committed here as binaries.

