1.2  Components bundled inside the WebRTC binaries
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The WebRTC binaries statically include a number of third-party components, each
under its own license. The full, authoritative text for all of them ships with
the iOS build and is committed in this repository at:

    WebRTCme.Bindings/Maui/WebRTCme.Bindings.Maui.iOS/
        WebRTC.xcframework/LICENSE.md

That file is the aggregate notice produced by the WebRTC build itself, and it
is the text to reproduce. It covers, in addition to WebRTC itself:

    abseil-cpp        dav1d             fft               fiat
    g711              g722              libaom            libc++
    libc++abi         libsrtp           libvpx            libyuv
    llvm-libc         nasm              ooura             opus
    perfetto          pffft             protobuf          rnnoise
    spl_sqrt_floor    boringssl

On Windows, four of these — abseil-cpp, boringssl, protobuf and libc++ — are
not statically linked and ship as separate DLLs beside WebRtcInterop.dll. They
are the same components under the same licenses.


