3. MICROSOFT VISUAL C++ RUNTIME  (Windows only)
================================================================================

The Windows native payload includes four Microsoft redistributable DLLs, so the
binding works on a machine without the Visual C++ runtime installed:

    msvcp140.dll        msvcp140_atomic_wait.dll
    vcruntime140.dll    vcruntime140_1.dll

These are redistributed under Microsoft's redistributable terms for the Visual
C++ runtime.

They are a deployment convenience rather than a requirement. An application
packaged as MSIX with the VC++ runtime as a framework dependency, or one that
states the runtime as a prerequisite, can remove them — see
WebRTCme.Bindings/Maui/WebRTCme.Bindings.Maui.Windows/native/win-x64/README.md.


