5. MANAGED DEPENDENCIES
================================================================================

The NuGet packages WebRTCme and WebRTCme.Middleware depend on managed packages
— Microsoft.Maui.Controls, Microsoft.AspNetCore.*, System.Reactive,
Macross.Json.Extensions, Utilme.*, and others — rather than embedding them.
NuGet resolves those for the consumer and each carries its own license, so they
are not reproduced here. The per-target-framework dependency list is in each
package's .nuspec.
